Current exoskeleton life: [0/249, 0/335, 0/402, 0/459, 0/509 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)]

You craft a set of steam powered armor that fits over your regular armor, enhancing your defense. The armor has [249, 335, 402, 459, 509 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] life, and 50% of all damage taken is redirected to it.

Your powered armour repairs 5% of it’s maximum life each turn, and each time you spend steam it will be repaired for [100%, 150%, 188%, 221%, 250% (TL1-5)] of the steam cost.

The armor's maximum life will increase with your Steampower.
